## Input Specifications
input_format: "Plain Text"
input_fields:
  - name: "source_text"
    type: "string"
    description: "The full text to be summarized."
examples:
  - input: "The brain processes reality through holographic systems and reaction-diffusion patterns..."
    description: "Summarizing a paragraph from an academic paper."

---

## Transformation Logic
steps:
  - step_number: 1
    description: "Extract key phrases and concepts from the source text."
    method: "Keyword Extraction"
    parameters:
      - name: "language_model"
        value: "GPT-based keyword extractor"
    examples:
      - input: "The brain processes reality through holographic systems and reaction-diffusion patterns..."
        output: "Key phrases: 'brain processes', 'holographic systems', 'reaction-diffusion patterns'"
  - step_number: 2
    description: "Group related phrases into coherent sentences."
    method: "Sentence Synthesis"
    parameters:
      - name: "max_length"
        value: 120
    examples:
      - input: "Key phrases: 'brain processes', 'holographic systems', 'reaction-diffusion patterns'"
        output: "The brain processes reality using holographic systems and reaction-diffusion patterns."

---

## Output Specifications
output_format: "Plain Text"
output_fields:
  - name: "summary"
    type: "string"
    description: "A concise summary of the source text."
examples:
  - output: "The brain processes reality using holographic systems and reaction-diffusion patterns."
    description: "Summarized output of the input text."

---

## Implementation Strategies
implementation_tips:
  - "Use pre-trained language models for effective keyword extraction."
  - "Tune summarization length based on the complexity of the source text."

